# Editor and tool scratch files that must never be committed.
#
# Three of these were committed to main by #34: lease/.idle.go.atomicwrite-112752008,
# -526108506 and -917872315. Two were empty and the third was a 219-line copy of
# lease/idle.go, i.e. a duplicate of source that nothing compiles and nothing
# updates -- the worst kind, because it reads as the real file.
#
# They are written beside the file being saved, by the editing tool and not by
# any code in this repository, so no cleanup here can prevent them; `git add -A`
# is what picks them up. This file is what stops that.
.*.atomicwrite-*

# Coverage and build output.
*.out
*.test
